        "excerpt": "Synthetic acceptance interview C. The researcher had interview notes ready to upload but could not quickly tell which project would receive them. They moved between the project page and the document list looking for an import control. A destination label beside the action would have reduced that uncertainty. They wanted the resulting message to confirm the document name and project instead of show",
